[[3,10,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892211\">7040L20</a></p><p>1. Unscrew the nuts.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connections (2a (2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Integrated services control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">M40A</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Integrated services control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">M40A</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Remove the integrated services control unit.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2061675.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,10,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the control unit is undamaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\ncontrol unit.</p><p>Place the control unit in position and\nsecure it using the nuts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2892211\">7040L20</a></p><p>Check that systems controlled by the control\nunit are working properly.</p>"]]